OL,3,GNEWSATaylor Drift and Salter Claus
OL,4,Aamong gritter names
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe public has named 62 gritters that
OL,7,Fwill spread salt on Kent's roads this
OL,8,Fwinter, with the winners including
OL,9,FGritney Spears, Sleetwood Mac and
OL,10,FTaylor Drift.
OL,12,FChildren from school holiday clubs were
OL,13,Fat Kent County Council's (KCC)
OL,14,FAylesford highway depot, where the
OL,15,Fwinning names were unveiled and the
OL,16,Fgritter lorries took to the road for
OL,17,Fthe first time in an annual "gritting
OL,18,Fparade".
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,323,320,200,140,0,100
